     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div><font face=\"Tahoma\">Dear all,</font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"Tahoma\"><br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"Tahoma\">it&#39;s not too late .... abstract submission deadline is in 2 weeks.</font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"Tahoma\"><br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"Tahoma\">Best regards  --- Marc<br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n<div bgcolor=\"#F6F6F6\" style=\"background:#f6f6f6\"><img alt=\"\" style=\"display:block\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/6Lu7fLv90q5oR26CzFHx_h1x14_drcwAgk7hrO37eTZ17bOI3F2NbhsKmrRGFOLAKhmHKD9ALXyJ8azPIAADpSPuPGixhZ2T7mFCqmD7pRcuAnGZGGwROLYi2X50vyQ_G7SxUaRtOKB1z2wnr9mRprSIORei4ERcukzKeDBUIlRSYhgwVQ=s0-d-e1-ft#https://live1.evread1.net/s/r/234972/1149015/317205736/1.gif?m=sKCWt1NLZ62S3Stw&amp;h=59d297b8662f843756ec472a0a889f6e\">\r\n<table style=\"color:#000000;font-family:Arial,&#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size:16px;line-height:20px\" width=\"800\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" align=\"center\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"line-height:7px\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://che01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fprotect-za.mimecast.com%2Fs%2FUFkCCWnKDqiokDE5f6J_rl&amp;data=04%...%40vogelwarte.ch%7Cb5c5e10a632f4c918a1508d9afdd63e2%7C251ae8d19a904569a35b9d2bc41188d2%7C1%7C0%7C637734187660176174%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000&amp;sdata=CmEZ6iBYHaUfc4HOnHyVsnr6tsWUumP3V5C%2FgeCUViU%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://che01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fprotect-za.mimecast.com%252Fs%252FUFkCCWnKDqiokDE5f6J_rl%26data%3D04%257C01%257Cmarc.kery%2540vogelwarte.ch%257Cb5c5e10a632f4c918a1508d9afdd63e2%257C251ae8d19a904569a35b9d2bc41188d2%257C1%257C0%257C637734187660176174%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%253D%257C3000%26sdata%3DCmEZ6iBYHaUfc4HOnHyVsnr6tsWUumP3V5C%252FgeCUViU%253D%26reserved%3D0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449672360000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2A9UJjMz6oqWmu7pIZxHFY\"><img alt=\"\" style=\"min-height:142px;width:426px\" width=\"426\" height=\"142\" src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/K_d5D5rWjI45pL2T2-EYQv0rBKhtK18pKRlSMzt88O29VQeWapMBZ6rl-2xUjLVE1SfI9uj14UR5IdjjTA-jVg5U1KXqzRfEn5A-FT5JUvhY9w=s0-d-e1-ft#https://cdn1.mailercdn.net/users/assets/304/images/logo(10).jpg\"></a><br>\r\n<img alt=\"\" style=\"min-height:431px;width:800px\" width=\"800\" height=\"431\" src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/cAkCVcA7K8rcTd1hpS9ovaHno6Dh0Ow4gLdamLB7xRfVulX2sIEyTLJvVLwC_NfTcVZkiuvML5Kn0uUuuTMebS9yRUuEBqfhdcYCVv465Dp3RFpgHwAyof0fbqc33uZjkutdoprB=s0-d-e1-ft#https://cdn1.mailercdn.net/users/assets/304/images/ChrisOosthuizen_ISEC_(4)-sig.jpg\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"30\" height=\"30\" bgcolor=\"#445950\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"740\" bgcolor=\"#445950\" align=\"center\">\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:26px;margin:0\">ABSTRACT SUBMISSION - REMINDER<br>\r\n<span style=\"color:#eabf13;font-size:14px\">Deadline for submission of abstracts: 9 December 2021</span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"30\" bgcolor=\"#445950\"><img alt=\"\" style=\"min-height:80px;width:30px\" width=\"30\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/EUzVBTU-VeJeyKEgsNbru-JrB7croZ1nsJ6r_oT-z-URwK95ZNZ-s7mJN4_SF6zItpjRCuXIhwNgIeqTkFNhStOLPFhO2ul52ya26I8xUoCAUGdoWVaq_CLH4g=s0-d-e1-ft#https://d2y0ltxfpojlex.cloudfront.net/users/assets/304/images/spacer.png\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"30\" height=\"30\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"740\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe ISEC 2022 Conference will showcase the latest works and interesting research findings of various statistical ecology related issues world-wide.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nAbstracts may be submitted online for Oral or Poster presentations for either in-person or virtual presentations.<br>\r\n   \r\n<table style=\"font-family:Arial,&#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size:16px\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"220\"></td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://che01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fprotect-za.mimecast.com%2Fs%2Fkv9NCX6XE5trJOQXUVDNBn&amp;data=04%...%40vogelwarte.ch%7Cb5c5e10a632f4c918a1508d9afdd63e2%7C251ae8d19a904569a35b9d2bc41188d2%7C1%7C0%7C637734187660176174%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000&amp;sdata=8ppsAtPRKRNgPmONZGyKDQnRguzDqZ28Kx3fHpW2Ul4%3D&amp;reserved=0\" style=\"color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://che01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fprotect-za.mimecast.com%252Fs%252Fkv9NCX6XE5trJOQXUVDNBn%26data%3D04%257C01%257Cmarc.kery%2540vogelwarte.ch%257Cb5c5e10a632f4c918a1508d9afdd63e2%257C251ae8d19a904569a35b9d2bc41188d2%257C1%257C0%257C637734187660176174%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%253D%257C3000%26sdata%3D8ppsAtPRKRNgPmONZGyKDQnRguzDqZ28Kx3fHpW2Ul4%253D%26reserved%3D0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449672360000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3bVktUobLxMq9LZyUoONI3\">Submit\r\n abstracts</a></td>\r\n<td width=\"220\"><img alt=\"\" style=\"min-height:30px;width:20px\" width=\"20\" height=\"30\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/EUzVBTU-VeJeyKEgsNbru-JrB7croZ1nsJ6r_oT-z-URwK95ZNZ-s7mJN4_SF6zItpjRCuXIhwNgIeqTkFNhStOLPFhO2ul52ya26I8xUoCAUGdoWVaq_CLH4g=s0-d-e1-ft#https://d2y0ltxfpojlex.cloudfront.net/users/assets/304/images/spacer.png\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n \r\n<h3>WORKSHOPS PROGRAMME</h3>\r\nISEC 2022 has an exciting pre-conference workshops programme planned. Bookings can be made using the conference registration form.<br>\r\n \r\n<table style=\"color:#000000;font-family:Arial,&#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size:16px;line-height:20px\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"7\" border=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#EABF13\"><b>Saturday, 25 June 2022</b><b> </b></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#F4F4F4\"><b>WORKSHOP 1:</b><br>\r\nModelling environmental DNA data<br>\r\n<b>09:00 – 17:00</b> <i>(Hybrid format)</i></td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#F4F4F4\">Eleni Matechou, <i>University of Kent UK</i><br>\r\nAlex Diana, <i>University of Kent UK</i></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"top\"><b>WORKSHOP 2:</b><br>\r\nTidy Data Manipulation and Animal Movement Modelling in R<br>\r\n<b>09:00 – 17:00</b> <i>(In-person only)</i></td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\">Devin Johnson, <i>NOAA-NMFS, USA</i><br>\r\nJosh London, <i>NOAA-NMFS, USA</i><br>\r\nBrett McClintock, <i>NOAA-NMFS, USA</i></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#F4F4F4\"><b>WORKSHOP 3:</b><br>\r\nHierarchical modeling with NIMBLE<br>\r\n<b>13:00 – 17:00</b> <i>(Virtual only)</i></td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#F4F4F4\">Perry de Valpine, <i>University of California, Berkley, USA</i><br>\r\nChris Paciorek<br>\r\nDaniel Turek</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\"><b> </b></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#EABF13\"><b>Sunday, 26 June 2022</b><b> </b></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#F4F4F4\"><b>WORKSHOP 4:</b><br>\r\nBayesian Analysis of Capture-Recapture Data with Hidden Markov Models in NIMBLE<br>\r\n<b>09:00 – 13:00</b> <i>(Virtual only)</i></td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#F4F4F4\">Olivier Gimenez, <i>CNRS, France</i><br>\r\nDaniel Turek, <i>Williams College, USA</i></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"top\"><b>WORKSHOP 5: </b><br>\r\nAdvances in quantifying space-use and habitat-selection of animals<br>\r\n<b>09:00 – 17:00</b> <i>(Hybrid format)</i></td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\">John Fieberg, <i>University of Minnesota, USA</i><br>\r\nTal Avgar, <i>Utah State University, USA</i><br>\r\nJohannes Signer, <i>University of Göttingen, Germany</i><br>\r\nBrian Smith, <i>Utah State University, USA</i></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#F4F4F4\"><b>WORKSHOP 6:</b><br>\r\nHidden Markov models for animal movement and other ecological data<br>\r\n<b>09:00 – 17:00</b> <i>(Hybrid format)</i></td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#F4F4F4\">Roland Langrock<br>\r\nSina Mews<br>\r\nThéo Michelot<br>\r\nRichard Glennie<br>\r\nTimo Adam</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<br>\r\nDetailed information can be found at: <a href=\"https://che01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fprotect-za.mimecast.com%2Fs%2FCz9vCY6YG5tB8A7Lc9Z7YH&amp;data=04%...%40vogelwarte.ch%7Cb5c5e10a632f4c918a1508d9afdd63e2%7C251ae8d19a904569a35b9d2bc41188d2%7C1%7C0%7C637734187660186129%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000&amp;sdata=vAif9lzVeI3rOPje167kCdaC%2B3V3mQsQQ2Xlzb6JB%2B0%3D&amp;reserved=0\" style=\"color:#000000\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://che01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fprotect-za.mimecast.com%252Fs%252FCz9vCY6YG5tB8A7Lc9Z7YH%26data%3D04%257C01%257Cmarc.kery%2540vogelwarte.ch%257Cb5c5e10a632f4c918a1508d9afdd63e2%257C251ae8d19a904569a35b9d2bc41188d2%257C1%257C0%257C637734187660186129%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%253D%257C3000%26sdata%3DvAif9lzVeI3rOPje167kCdaC%252B3V3mQsQQ2Xlzb6JB%252B0%253D%26reserved%3D0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449672360000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3LnenTxk-NtJ-HGR9n439H\">\r\n<b>www.isec2022.org/workshops</b></a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n </td>\r\n<td width=\"3